  "@type": "schema:ScholarlyArticle",
  "schema:name": "Defining epitranscriptomic hallmarks at the host-parasite interface and their roles in virulence and disease progression in Theileria annulata -infected leukocytes.",
  "schema:datePublished": "2025-01-02",
